            "title": "What's Included",
            "content": "<ul><li>Myocalme Pro device<\/li><li>Rechargeable battery <\/li><li>Lead wire<\/li><li>Ear clips<\/li><li>Charging cable<\/li><li>2oz Restore conductive gel <\/li><li>Vitalizing Sheet Mask <\/li><li>Revital C Serum<\/li><li>Instruction manual<\/li><li><strong>FREE Anti Aging Serum <\/strong><\/li><\/ul>",
