        "tab": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How To Use",
            "content": "<ol><li>Lie down in a comfortable position<\/li><li>Plug in the cable and ear clips. <\/li><li>Add conductive gel and pinch it in between the ear clip. Wear the ear clips on your ear lobes. (make sure you don't have any ear jewellery on). <\/li><li>Turn on the device by pressing the middle button once. A long beep will indicate that it's turned on and deliver  the current at Level 1. You may increase the level by tapping the middle button again. At level 2 you might feel like you are rocking on a boat. This is a normal sensation and will go away in 5 mins.<\/li><li>Wear the Myocalme device until it turns OFF for 30 mins.<\/li><li>Recharge until the next day.<\/li><\/ol>",
            "page": ""
