        "text_xAtcyp": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<p>The Myocalme Pro is a microcurrent technology that has a frequency specific waveform delivered on the ear lobes to impact the deep neurological pathways to balance out the brain activities and induce alpha signals in the brain. The alpha state is typically referred to a very calm and relaxed state of the brain activity. <\/p><p>The Myocalme Pro creates an ideal homeostasis balance in the neurological pathway placing it in the parasympathetic restoration zone. In other words, Myocalme Pro helps stimulate a deep relaxation that can reduce chronic stress and nurture sleep.<\/p>"
          }
        }
